      "markdown": "# Whiteboard: three-minute tour\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "Welcome",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "markdown": "A session is a guided, interactive explanation of a code change. The document\nkeeps the important code and system views in one place.\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "tutorial",
          "kind": "conversation",
          "conversation": {
            "version": 1,
            "title": "How this session was made",
            "messages": [
              {
                "role": "user",
                "body": "/whiteboard I'd like to review the feature we just worked on."
              },
              {
                "role": "assistant",
                "body": "Ok, I'm on it..."
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "markdown": "### Your keybindings\n\nChoose your editor keys. Whiteboard highlights the active choice and uses its\nexisting extension and reload flow for Vim and Emacs.\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "tutorial",
          "kind": "keymap"
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "markdown": "### Put the keybindings to work\n\nThe editor below is live. Try hover, **Go to Definition**, or **Go to\nReferences** with the same commands you use in VS Code.\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "code_peek",
          "source": {
            "file": "src/orders/order-service.ts",
            "start": {
              "side": "head",
              "line": 13
            },
            "end": {
              "side": "head",
              "line": 29
            }
          },
          "caption": "Order service creates the order"
