      "children": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "markdown": "Whiteboard pins an exact base and head before the agent starts writing. Open\n**Commits** to see the change in author order. Expand the sample commit to see\nits files, then choose **Open diff** to inspect only that commit.\n\nThe **Diff** tab shows the complete change between the pinned base and head.\nChoose **Session** when you are ready to return to this tour.\n"
        },
